# Products endpoints tests

@host = localhost:8080/api/v1

### Create new product
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Screen",
  "productionTime": 24,
  "cost": 500,
  "stock": 5
}

### Get all products
GET {{host}}/products


### Update product
PUT {{host}}/products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated product"
}

### GET product by id
GET {{host}}/products/4


### Delete product
DELETE {{host}}/products/4
